{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "091622ccbda88e6d3a0c772bdded9331cbe456434c65556bbc3a3e87d5286e33", "ja": "（今日はひなたのデザインした洋服のPR写真を\n撮るため、早朝から北海道の各地を回っている）", "zh": "（今天为了拍摄日向设计的服装宣传照，从一大早开始就在北海道各地奔波。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "ddfd7c18450aa6b58f71636ce1ef7150843c35797646d098b0449b36eeadca13", "ja": "ひゃ～、時計台でも写真を撮るのかい？\nこんな素敵な場所で、本当にいいのかねぇ。", "zh": "呀～，还要在钟楼拍照片吗？\n在这么棒的地方拍，真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fa535d13749afb9d04e14a400dc0a812438cf812145e80dcd28a928d40d9b958", "ja": "もちろんだよ。\nとびきり素敵で魅力的な写真にしような。", "zh": "当然了。\n拍出一张绝妙又充满魅力的照片吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "a134a2b62c6ba267f3054a740f1e6f15edc59b4f1de3272ef65860c720c689f9", "ja": "魅力的……うん、そうだねぇ。あたし、さっきから\nふわふわしてるみたいで。気持ちを引き締めないと。", "zh": "有魅力……嗯，是啊。我从刚才开始就感觉心里飘飘忽忽的。得让自己打起精神来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e0b89befda3c0cc88adc2a7831d0b9b97aab5fe7e408c2151305865b838cb7b4", "ja": "ふわふわしてる？　というと……。", "zh": "你说的“心里飘飘然”？也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "56c0c10c47bda35e159a7747349c819aa372d5b97e5c719f0c677226fbada608", "ja": "うんとね……今日は大事なお仕事でしょや？\nだからがんばらねば、って思うんだけども。", "zh": "嗯……今天是很重要的工作，对吧？所以我本来想着，得加把劲才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "370477b0dbb6e79532574e4ebb6d7d748eaeeceb530d317c78ebfd1c0855ec66", "ja": "いろんなところに行くたびに、気が抜けちゃって……。\n今日は楽しいことばっかだからかなぁ？", "zh": "每次去到各种地方，我就会不知不觉放松下来……。是因为今天尽是开心的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c6d6f6e0326ce9852c9b7ccf3abb85f6aa4251b557757928f08297cd4e8c8dae", "ja": "そういえば……。この仕事が決まってから\nひなたはずっと嬉しそうだったな。", "zh": "说起来……自从这份工作定下来以后，  \n日向就一直一副很开心的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "23413596f73f958568f7de0ac5d00023884e6fd2efd7a0f6b7643028200ab20a", "ja": "うん！　だって、服を考えさせてもらうってだけでも\nなまらすごいことなのに……。", "zh": "嗯！因为，光是能让我来设计服装，就已经是非常了不起的事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "1942aaa565e3a0f3d1ff05d698feb6d6b38784b08e2de3b49670b92994a86687", "ja": "大好きな地元で、大好きな服を着られて……。\nつい、ふわふわした気持ちになっちゃうんだ。", "zh": "在最喜欢的家乡，穿着最喜欢的衣服……\n不知不觉就变得飘飘然了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1010_p", "source_sha256": "74bcf36bebef7b9cc8c6198649317503dd057eed63c1dd5569d5c543df39b2be", "ja": "はは、そうか。それなら今日は余計なことは考えずに\n思う存分、楽しんでいいと思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。那今天就别想多余的事了，尽情享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "94d797d160fd7c38b47a787c814fbe487ea800cf6f1270dd3a6723712dfe5371", "ja": "でも……それだと、\nあたしが楽しむだけの写真になってしまわないかい？", "zh": "可是……那样的话，不就成了只让我自己开心的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_1012", "source_sha256": "a85a122147e5630b26e2f8f6e2614a5983fd33d87c8c5ae60f4d83b50e88ce23", "ja": "それでいい！", "zh": "这就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6595fa29e142aebdfe3716e6d28fbde0a09a58cad0a661adb0d975136693fbcc", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。逆に楽しんだ方が、写真を見た人たちが\n実際に行ってみたいと、惹かれるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "没问题的。不如说好好享受其中，看了照片的人\n反而会受到吸引，想要亲自去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2001_p", "source_sha256": "6728bbf69377d7c9b15c30ae05de8d684764a170c2df99c88e942637012c2c73", "ja": "ひなたのことを羨ましいと思うくらい……\nひなたの魅力でいっぱいの写真にしよう！", "zh": "要拍出充满阳向魅力的照片，让人羡慕阳向到这种程度……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2002_035hin", "source_sha256": "f89dc1f82a7cc62f892913481c579c6155bea60f9862366deb1cdc0058f03872", "ja": "でも、お仕事だけど、なんだか申し訳ないような……。", "zh": "不过，虽然这是工作，总觉得有点过意不去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2003_p", "source_sha256": "ad1d9b309f07ef6c12bfb244cdb1202ba6927fd6e70525b30373065b4f6ca64b", "ja": "いいんだよ。ひなたはいつも頑張ってるからね。\nこれは、ご褒美だと思ってほしい。", "zh": "没关系。因为日向一直都很努力。\n就把这个当作奖励吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2004_035hin", "source_sha256": "3e7c33a80bc02608407f42227892f2fec9a55f4c6df57613414df0cb30d8431e", "ja": "ご褒美……えへへ、そっかぁ。何だか難しく\n考えてたけど、素直に楽しんでよかったんだねぇ。", "zh": "奖励……嘿嘿，原来如此啊。之前总觉得这件事很难，可其实坦率地享受就好了，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2005_p", "source_sha256": "06bf2bd2b75519cb1c5f2ab232c787b94c668ed15299c978057c2517e3af4b5a", "ja": "ああ。北海道で伸び伸びと楽しむひなたの姿は、\n最高のPRになると思うよ！", "zh": "嗯。在北海道尽情享受的日向，她的身姿一定会成为最棒的宣传！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2006_035hin", "source_sha256": "42e703a7e001b319a595caafde47c0df816473a3ee4a5a1df6661e47fa9caa7b", "ja": "うん！　……したっけ、\n{$P$}にひとつお願いがあるんだわ。", "zh": "嗯！……那么，我有一件事想拜托{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2007_p", "source_sha256": "de45084e4f5c13026123031e336ad8e25343ecec0037e58023b9d847e6962b98", "ja": "お願い？", "zh": "请求？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2008_035hin", "source_sha256": "89166afb0d804e05e1cbe6e39c0a67682313daf12a8e1167d8831b66a9f2c874", "ja": "あのね、お仕事の写真を撮ったら……\nちょっとだけ、観光する時間を取ってもらえないかい？", "zh": "那个呀，拍完工作的照片之后……\n能不能稍微空出一点时间，让我们观光一下呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2009_035hin", "source_sha256": "38fac6defc64f9b8e94b20b7aecc0bdc53d4225c3ae760a37b55d5981ba30f87", "ja": "{$P$}に案内してあげたくて。\n写真じゃ伝わらない魅力も教えてあげるね。えへへ♪", "zh": "想带{$P$}到处逛逛呢。\n照片里感受不到的魅力，我也统统告诉你哦。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0554_2010_p", "source_sha256": "be6f513a4c28c043e4bf31ae3bbcefe6d4cbbece963eb16c27ac9781bcfe3274", "ja": "（そして撮影で各地を回りながら、ひなたと観光した。\n素晴らしい写真もたくさん！　お土産もいっぱいだ！）", "zh": "（然后我们一边为了拍摄走遍各地，一边和日向游览了各处。拍了好多精彩的照片！还买了好多特产！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
